cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: jyotirganita
abstract: >-
  A deterministic, fully parameterized pañcāṅgam computation engine for the
  scientific study of Indian calendrical traditions — historical almanacs,
  inscriptions, and siddhantic astronomy. Version 0.0.1 is a placeholder
  release that reserves the package name; the engine is under active
  development.
type: software
